flowchart TB
  P[Future provider delivery\nnot connected by this design]
  V[Bounded raw-byte verification\nbefore parse]
  I[Verified provider installation\nkey generation only]
  B[Historical verified asset binding\ninstallation + connection + exact asset + capability]
  S[Exactly one organization + school\nproven by binding]

  subgraph noSchool[Fail-closed / non-school handling]
    R1[SIGNATURE_REJECTED\nnon-PII security telemetry only]
    R2[MALFORMED_REJECTED]
    R3[UNSUPPORTED_VERSION_QUARANTINED\nonly if approved bounded operator plane]
    R4[UNKNOWN_BINDING_QUARANTINED]
    R5[AMBIGUOUS_BINDING_QUARANTINED]
    R6[RETRY_AMBIGUOUS_RECONCILIATION_REQUIRED]
    C[IDENTITY_CONFLICT\nimmutable different-digest evidence]
  end

  subgraph school[Future school-scoped boundary after unique proof]
    E[Stable event + delivery attempt\nsource occurrence + pinned resolution]
    Y[REPLAY_RECORDED\nreturns original durable outcome]
    N[Protected normalized candidate V1\nonly after PII-custody approval]
    Q[Metadata-only review case]
    D[Qualified direct-human disposition]
    X[Unique CRM effect reservation\ntransaction-aware canonical create]
    A[Redacted audit + non-dispatchable\nintegration evidence]
  end

  P --> V
  V -->|signature invalid / missing| R1
  V -->|verified signature| I
  I -->|authenticated envelope malformed| R2
  I -->|unsupported adapter/schema| R3
  I --> B
  B -->|no unique historical proof| R4
  B -->|two schools or unprovable cutover| R5
  B -->|one proven school| S --> E
  E -->|same identity + same digest| Y
  E -->|prior durable outcome cannot be proven| R6
  E -->|same identity + different digest| C
  E --> N --> Q --> D
  D -->|CREATE_DISTINCT_NEW_LEAD only after live rechecks| X --> A
  D -->|SKIP / REJECT / EVIDENCE / ESCALATE| A

  classDef future fill:#fff5e6,stroke:#a35b00,color:#3d2600
  classDef trust fill:#eaf7ff,stroke:#126782,color:#082a39
  classDef exception fill:#fff0f1,stroke:#a51c30,color:#4a0610
  classDef protected fill:#eefbf4,stroke:#197345,color:#092b18
  class P future
  class V,I,B,S trust
  class R1,R2,R3,R4,R5,R6,C exception
  class E,Y,N,Q,D,X,A protected
